# Next rewrites this on every dev and build, and the two disagree: `next dev`
# points it at .next/dev/types/, `next build` at .next/types/. Tracked, it
# flips back and forth in the diff of anyone who ran the other command last.
# Next regenerates it, so nothing is lost by ignoring it.
